      "writtenOn": "2022-04-06T21:40:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Ack. Indeed, there are a lot of similarities between the metal backend and what I\u0027m building for WGSL. This and pipeline stage IO parameter injection into functions (i.e. \"function requirements\" in the MetalCodeGenerator) are two examples. I would like to find ways for the two backends to either share more code or take advantage some set of pre-codegen transformations to the IR.",
